Mixed CAN and CAN-FD Network Demo
==================================

This example demonstrates Classical CAN and CAN-FD frames coexisting on the same bus.

Network:
- canNode: Sends GREEN frames (Classical CAN, 8 bytes, ID=100)
- canFdNode: Sends BLUE frames (CAN-FD, 64 bytes, ID=50)

Run:
  ./run omnetpp.ini          # GUI mode
  ./run -u Cmdenv omnetpp.ini # Command-line mode

Observe:
- Blue CAN-FD frames transmit faster despite 8x more data
- Proper arbitration (ID 50 wins over ID 100)
- Color-coded visualization
